         <p class="twoColumn__TextArea--Desc has_splitting--effect">Stick it on the cart, your bag, or even your fridge. The ultra-strong magnetic strip makes it incredibly easy to bring with you and use wherever you’re at, always keeping your GPS and music within reach.</p>
